1
00:00:02,336 --> 00:00:05,106
What color would you like to be?

2
00:00:05,106 --> 00:00:07,806
(Leonard:)Well, I'd like to be green,
but you know you always take it.

3
00:00:07,808 --> 00:00:09,278
(Sheldon:)That's not true.

4
00:00:09,276 --> 00:00:10,806
Any color's fine with me.

5
00:00:10,811 --> 00:00:14,011
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I could be a-a combination
of blue and yellow.

6
00:00:15,116 --> 00:00:17,286
(Leonard:)Blue and yellow make green.

7
00:00:17,284 --> 00:00:18,914
(Sheldon:)Well, then it's settled.

8
00:00:20,488 --> 00:00:21,788
(Penny:)Hi. Ready to go?

9
00:00:21,789 --> 00:00:24,159
(Sheldon:)Oh, good news, we ordered lunch,

10
00:00:24,158 --> 00:00:26,958
(Sheldon:)so we can all stay here
and play Lord of the Rings Risk.

11
00:00:26,961 --> 00:00:30,701
(Amy:)Sheldon, we said that we would
play games with you tonight.

12
00:00:30,698 --> 00:00:32,298
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, we'll still
be playing it tonight--

13
00:00:32,299 --> 00:00:34,799
(Sheldon:)this game can easily
take eight hours.

14
00:00:34,802 --> 00:00:36,672
(Penny:)Sweetie, you really thought
I'd want to do this?

15
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:38,140
(Leonard:)No.
Well, did you
tell him that?

16
00:00:38,139 --> 00:00:40,969
(Leonard:)Yes.
Did you say it
out loud with words?

17
00:00:40,975 --> 00:00:43,645
(Leonard:)No.

18
00:00:43,644 --> 00:00:46,144
(Penny:)I don't want to spend the whole
day playing a board game.

19
00:00:46,147 --> 00:00:48,047
(Sheldon:)Yeah, well, you may change
your mind when you hear

20
00:00:48,049 --> 00:00:50,649
(Sheldon:)that this is the
new expanded edition

21
00:00:50,651 --> 00:00:52,651
(Sheldon:)which contains a more
complete map of Middle Earth,

22
00:00:52,653 --> 00:00:54,723
(Sheldon:)now including
the Haradwaith Territories.

23
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:58,160
(Amy:)I will literally
race you to the car.

24
00:00:58,159 --> 00:01:01,389
(Leonard:)No, no, no, come on,
don't leave. Just try it.

